them as prey to be ripped apart by their teeth.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"We escaped from them like a bird flying out of a hunter's trap. The trap was broken and we flew away!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Our help comes from the Lord, who made heaven and earth.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_fbv/PSA/124.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_fbv/PSA/125.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_fbv/PSA/123.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}